      "comment": "The generated MyHeritage URL used birth_place=Schuylkill+County%2C+Pennsylvania, but the resolved c_001 conflict establishes Ireland as Patrick Flynn’s preferred birthplace. Schuylkill County is the census residence/jurisdiction, not his birthplace, and the MyHeritage template has no separate residence field. The URL therefore encodes a rejected birthplace and misuses the birth_place parameter."
    },
