      "comment": "The URL should have used birth_place=Ireland, reflecting the resolved conflict. It should not have encoded Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania as birth_place, because that is the census location rather than Patrick’s resolved birthplace and the template provides no separate residence/jurisdiction parameter."
